        "answer": {
          "short": "$B=(3,0)$",
          "worked": "On the $x$-axis, $y=0$.\n$$\\begin{align*}5x-3(0)&=15\\\\5x&=15\\\\x&=3\\end{align*}$$\nTherefore $B=(3,0)$.",
